<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Quantus Chile SpA | Inteligencia Artificial y Gestión Empresarial</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Quantus combina gestión empresarial, automatización e inteligencia artificial en un solo ecosistema para pymes chilenas.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.quantuschile.cl/">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Quantus Chile SpA">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Quantus Chile SpA | Inteligencia Artificial y Gestión Empresarial">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Vigilancia del Diario Oficial, licitaciones, marcas y automatización con IA para pymes chilenas. Observamos, analizamos y trabajamos por tu empresa las 24 horas.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.quantuschile.cl/">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.quantuschile.cl/static/quantus-logo-clean.png">
  <meta property="og:locale" content="es_CL">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Quantus Chile SpA | Inteligencia Artificial y Gestión Empresarial">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Vigilancia del Diario Oficial, licitaciones, marcas y automatización con IA para pymes chilenas.">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='quantus-logo-clean.png') }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='style.css') }}">
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy-bg: #ffffff;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --card-border: #e2e8f0;
      --cyan-bright: #0284c7;
      --text-main: #0f172a;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }

    .hero-highlight-phrase {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7 0%, #1d4ed8 45%, #6d28d9 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      font-weight: 900;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .highlight-letter-i {
      color: #0284c7 !important;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: #0284c7 !important;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .dark-hero {
      position: relative;
      padding: 95px 0 120px;
      isolation: isolate;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fafc 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .dark-hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: -1;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 64px 64px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0,0,0,0.8), transparent 85%);
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0,0,0,0.8), transparent 85%);
    }

    .dark-hero-shell {
      width: min(calc(100% - 48px), 1280px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.25);
      color: #0284c7;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .eyebrow-pill::before {
      content: "";
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #0284c7;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.6);
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(44px, 5.5vw, 72px);
      line-height: 1.12;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      max-width: 980px;
    }

    .hero-lead {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #475569;
      margin: 0 auto 42px;
      max-width: 780px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .feature-pills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
      max-width: 980px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .feature-pill-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    .feature-pill-item:hover {
      border-color: #0284c7;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.12);
    }

    .feature-pill-item img {
      height: 42px;
      width: auto;
      max-width: 100px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .cyan-banner-pill {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08) 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08) 100%);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.25);
      color: #0284c7;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      max-width: 780px;
    }

    .hero-actions-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .btn-primary-cyan {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7 0%, #2563eb 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.35);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary-cyan:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.45);
    }

    .btn-secondary-outline {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-secondary-outline:hover {
      border-color: #0284c7;
      color: #0284c7;
      background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.04);
    }

    /* BARRA DE MÉTRICAS 8K */
    .metrics-stats-bar {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 900px;
      padding-top: 40px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .metric-stat-item {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .metric-stat-val {
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #0284c7;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .metric-stat-lbl {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .btn-primary-cyan:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.5);
    }

    .btn-secondary-dark {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
      color: #f1f5f9;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-secondary-dark:hover {
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9);
      border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
    }

    /* Right column preview cards */
    .hero-preview-column {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .ley-banner-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(11, 23, 43, 0.9);
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.28);
    }

    .ley-banner-card span {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #f8fafc;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .ley-banner-btn {
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #38bdf8;
      color: #03172e;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .preview-section-label {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: #64748b;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .preview-card {
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: rgba(11, 23, 43, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .preview-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
    }

    .card-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .tag-do { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); color: #fca5a5; border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3); }
    .tag-mp { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2); color: #86efac; border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3); }
    .tag-inapi { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: #fde047; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); }
    .tag-erp { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: #7dd3fc; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0 0 4px;
    }

    .card-sub {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* Additional landing sections — White Premium Light Mode */
    .ecosystem-section {
      padding: 90px 0;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .section-shell {
      width: min(calc(100% - 48px), 1280px);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 56px;
    }

    .section-kicker {
      color: #0284c7;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 3.8vw, 42px);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #0f172a;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }

    .section-desc {
      font-size: 16.5px;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .grid-3col {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .grid-2col {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .mod-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 28px 26px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 240px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    .mod-card:hover {
      border-color: #0284c7;
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.12);
    }

    .mod-card-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .mod-card-logo {
      height: 38px;
      width: auto;
      max-width: 110px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 6px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .mod-card h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .mod-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .mod-link {
      color: #0284c7;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-top: 22px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .mod-link:hover {
      color: #0369a1;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .dark-hero-shell {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .grid-3col, .grid-2col {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  {% include "partials/nav_header.html" %}

  <main>
    <section class="dark-hero">
      <div class="dark-hero-shell">
        <div class="eyebrow-pill">
          🚀 Plataforma 100% cloud · Hecha en Chile
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          El sistema de gestión <span class="hero-highlight-phrase"><span class="highlight-letter-i">i</span>nteligente para tu negocio</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">
          Punto de venta, inventario, dashboard con IA, app shopper y app cliente. Todo integrado en una sola plataforma. Sin instalaciones, sin contratos largos.
        </p>

        <div class="feature-pills-grid">
          <div class="feature-pill-item">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='logo_real_diario_oficial.jpg') }}" alt="Diario Oficial de la República de Chile">
            <span>Monitoreo del Diario Oficial</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-pill-item">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='mercadopublico.png') }}" alt="Mercado Público Chile">
            <span>Licitaciones Mercado Público</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-pill-item">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='gob.svg') }}" alt="INAPI — Gobierno de Chile">
            <span>Marcas INAPI &amp; Vigilancia</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-pill-item">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='logo_real_dicrep.png') }}" alt="DICREP — Tía Rica">
            <span>Remates DICREP &amp; Judiciales</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-pill-item">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='quantus-logo-clean.png') }}" alt="Quantus ERP">
            <span>Control de Stock &amp; Caja POS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-pill-item">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='quantus-logo-clean.png') }}" alt="Quantus Calendario">
            <span>Calendario de Eventos &amp; Agenda</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-actions-row">
          <a href="mailto:contacto@quantuschile.cl?subject=Solicitud%20Demo%20Gratis" class="btn-primary-cyan">
            Solicitar Demo Gratis
          </a>
          <a href="/punto-de-venta/acceso" class="btn-secondary-outline">
            Ya soy cliente → Acceder
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Barra de Métricas de Confianza 8K -->
        <div class="metrics-stats-bar">
          <div class="metric-stat-item">
            <div class="metric-stat-val">5</div>
            <div class="metric-stat-lbl">Rubros disponibles</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-stat-item">
            <div class="metric-stat-val">100%</div>
            <div class="metric-stat-lbl">Cloud · Sin instalación</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-stat-item">
            <div class="metric-stat-val">24/7</div>
            <div class="metric-stat-lbl">Acceso desde cualquier lugar</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Solutions Grid Section -->
    <section id="ecosistema" class="ecosystem-section">
      <div class="section-shell">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-kicker">Soluciones Integradas</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Ecosistema Quantus Intelligence</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">Herramientas especializadas conectadas por una capa común de inteligencia operacional y legal.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3col">
          <div class="mod-card">
            <div>
              <div class="mod-card-head">
                <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='logo_real_diario_oficial.jpg') }}" alt="Diario Oficial" class="mod-card-logo">
                <h3>Diario Oficial</h3>
              </div>
              <p>Radar 24/7 de edictos, citaciones y notificaciones con análisis IA explicativo.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/do" class="mod-link">Ver Radar Diario Oficial →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="mod-card">
            <div>
              <div class="mod-card-head">
                <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='mercadopublico.png') }}" alt="Mercado Público" class="mod-card-logo">
                <h3>Mercado Público</h3>
              </div>
              <p>Detección automática de licitaciones relevantes según rubro y capacidad.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/licitaciones" class="mod-link">Ver Licitaciones →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="mod-card">
            <div>
              <div class="mod-card-head">
                <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='gob.svg') }}" alt="INAPI" class="mod-card-logo">
                <h3>Marcas INAPI</h3>
              </div>
              <p>Registro asistido y vigilancia preventiva contra solicitudes similares.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/inapi" class="mod-link">Ver Vigilancia Marcas →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="mod-card">
            <div>
              <div class="mod-card-head">
                <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='logo_real_dicrep.png') }}" alt="Remates DICREP" class="mod-card-logo">
                <h3>Remates Inmobiliarios</h3>
              </div>
              <p>Alerta temprana de inmuebles en remate judicial y DICREP por comuna y presupuesto.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/remates" class="mod-link">Ver Remates →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="mod-card">
            <div>
              <div class="mod-card-head">
                <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='quantus-logo-clean.png') }}" alt="Ley 21.719" class="mod-card-logo">
                <h3>Ley 21.719 Protección Datos</h3>
              </div>
              <p>Diagnóstico de cumplimiento normativo y evidencia auditable.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/checklist-ley-21719" class="mod-link">Ver Checklist →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="mod-card">
            <div>
              <div class="mod-card-head">
                <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='quantus-logo-clean.png') }}" alt="Quantus ERP" class="mod-card-logo">
                <h3>Punto de venta &amp; Inventario inteligente</h3>
              </div>
              <p>Gestión de ventas, compras, caja e inventario con inteligencia analítica.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/erp" class="mod-link">Ver Punto de Venta →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  {% include "partials/legal_footer.html" %}

</body>
</html>
